   "text": "PE1’s normal path is the direct link (cost 10). P1→P4 costs\n20, P4→P1 costs 40.",
   "originalText": "PE1’s normal path is the direct link (cost 10). P1→P4 costs\n20, P4→P1 costs 40.",
