   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: one card per method, the same five fields",
   "originalText": "How it works: one card per method, the same five fields",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a11-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 720,
   "height": 140,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "            LFA     Remote LFA                       TI-LFA\n----------  ------  -------------------------------  ----------------------\nfound/used  none    used: PQ node PE2, exit via P2   found, not used\npath        –       PE1→P2→P4→PE2→P3→P1              PE1→P2→P1\ncost        –       10 + 10 + 10 + 10 + 10 = 50      10 + 30 = 40\nlabels      –       16012 16001  (PE2, then P1)      24000 16001\nvs final    –       longer (final is 40)             same",
   "originalText": "            LFA     Remote LFA                       TI-LFA\n----------  ------  -------------------------------  ----------------------\nfound/used  none    used: PQ node PE2, exit via P2   found, not used\npath        –       PE1→P2→P4→PE2→P3→P1              PE1→P2→P1\ncost        –       10 + 10 + 10 + 10 + 10 = 50      10 + 30 = 40\nlabels      –       16012 16001  (PE2, then P1)      24000 16001\nvs final    –       longer (final is 40)             same",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a11-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 316,
   "width": 224,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "What each field means",
   "originalText": "What each field means",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a11-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 350,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 170,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  found / used: does the method have a backup, and is it the one the results table names (the\n   simplest, ECMP → LFA → Remote LFA → TI-LFA)?\n•  path: LFA = S → N, then N’s normal path. Remote LFA = the tunnel to the PQ node, then its normal\n   path. TI-LFA = the post-convergence path.\n•  cost: the metrics walked. LFA = c(S,N) + dist(N,D); Remote LFA = cost to the PQ node + dist(PQ,D).\n•  labels S pushes, top first, before PHP: LFA 0 extra, Remote LFA the PQ node’s Prefix-SID, TI-LFA its\n   segment list.\n•  vs final: against S’s path after reconvergence: same, same-cost or longer. Never cheaper.",
   "originalText": "•  found / used: does the method have a backup, and is it the one the results table names (the\n   simplest, ECMP → LFA → Remote LFA → TI-LFA)?\n•  path: LFA = S → N, then N’s normal path. Remote LFA = the tunnel to the PQ node, then its normal\n   path. TI-LFA = the post-convergence path.\n•  cost: the metrics walked. LFA = c(S,N) + dist(N,D); Remote LFA = cost to the PQ node + dist(PQ,D).\n•  labels S pushes, top first, before PHP: LFA 0 extra, Remote LFA the PQ node’s Prefix-SID, TI-LFA its\n   segment list.\n•  vs final: against S’s path after reconvergence: same, same-cost or longer. Never cheaper.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a11-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 530,
   "width": 341,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
