   "versionNonce": 6807385,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "With links or routers down (§10.1): the cards show what the traffic really does",
   "originalText": "With links or routers down (§10.1): the cards show what the traffic really does",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a11-text-66",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1148,
   "width": 1581,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 522654,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6912114,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The view runs the failure simulation (A9) once per repair mode and lines up the flow to D. Each card: delivered / dropped / loops, the path, which routers repair, the\ncost against normal, the labels, and the repair against the final path.",
   "originalText": "The view runs the failure simulation (A9) once per repair mode and lines up the flow to D. Each card: delivered / dropped / loops, the path, which routers repair, the\ncost against normal, the labels, and the repair against the final path.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a11-text-67",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1201,
   "width": 1134,
   "height": 94,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 530573,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7016843,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Failure                          LFA only                   LFA + Remote LFA        TI-LFA\n-------------------------------  -------------------------  ----------------------  ----------------------------------------\nEx. 3, S→E, link S–E             dropped at S (no backup)   dropped at S            delivered S-A-B-C-E, 13, 16004 24005 16002\nEx. 6, S→D, router E             delivered S-N-M-D, 21      same as LFA only        loops S→N→S: [Prefix D] via N meets E\nEx. 4, PE1→P3, PE1–P1 + P2–P4    dropped at PE1             delivered, 70 (> 50)    delivered, 100 (> 50): PE1, P2, PE1 repair",
   "originalText": "Failure                          LFA only                   LFA + Remote LFA        TI-LFA\n-------------------------------  -------------------------  ----------------------  ----------------------------------------\nEx. 3, S→E, link S–E             dropped at S (no backup)   dropped at S            delivered S-A-B-C-E, 13, 16004 24005 16002\nEx. 6, S→D, router E             delivered S-N-M-D, 21      same as LFA only        loops S→N→S: [Prefix D] via N meets E\nEx. 4, PE1→P3, PE1–P1 + P2–P4    dropped at PE1             delivered, 70 (> 50)    delivered, 100 (> 50): PE1, P2, PE1 repair",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
